  // New Beginning (Prestige 1)
  //
  // REMOVED: this override was a no-op targeting the wrong task's
  // objective. Objective 6848100b00afffa81f09e36b does not exist on Prestige 1
  // (6761f28a022f60bb320f3e95) - it belongs to Prestige 3
  // (6848100b00afffa81f09e365), where upstream reads exactly the "Was:" text
  // the comment recorded ("Use the transit from The Lab to Streets of Tarkov"),
  // confirming the ID was copied from Prestige 3.
  //
  // The override's intent is already satisfied: Prestige 1's own equivalent
  // objective (6761f9d718fa62aac3264ff2) already reads "Survive and extract
  // from The Lab" upstream.
  //
  // It was NOT retargeted to Prestige 3 because Prestige 3's wording is correct.
